  "notes": "Only the history variant is here. The plan also names the core goldens InvokeHostFunctionTests f9e9d669f79493b3 (custom asset, frame 11) and 6c3fc64cf8dffa5d (native asset, frame 9); each of their ledgers has 1 transaction, 1 event and 12 entry changes, against this ledger's 9 transactions, 21 events and 102 entry changes, so they cannot share this entry's expect block and are not added as variants. The executed golden mirror of f9e9d669f79493b3 frame 11 is recorded under mirrors. The recipient contract's own ledger entries do not change (its balance lives in the SAC's storage), so it is a movement endpoint, not a must-include participant. The wallet-backend (pre-#792) and JavaScript SDK 16.4.x pins have not been executed against this ledger, so they are not known divergences.",
